From: Spaceghost <spaceghost@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ARM: use unified syntax for conditional flag-setting rsb

Place the flag-setting suffix before the condition code for LLVM's unified
assembler syntax.

---
 arch/arm/include/asm/spinlock.h | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm/include/asm/spinlock.h b/arch/arm/include/asm/spinlock.h
index 15e14d3..253f46d 100644
--- a/arch/arm/include/asm/spinlock.h
+++ b/arch/arm/include/asm/spinlock.h
@@ -222,1 +222,1 @@
-"	rsbpls	%0, %1, #0\n"
+"	rsbspl	%0, %1, #0\n"
-- 
2.30.2
